@startuml model_arch_mil
!theme plain
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam rectangle {
  RoundCorner 10
  BackgroundColor #EAF2FB
  BorderColor #1F618D
  FontSize 16
}
skinparam Padding 6
skinparam nodesep 25
skinparam ranksep 25

title <size:22><b>CNN + Attention-MIL — Architecture</b></size>

rectangle "<b>WSI (Whole Slide Image)</b>\n100k × 100k px · plusieurs Go" as WSI #FCEBEA

rectangle "<b>Extraction de patchs</b>\nTuiles 256 × 256 px\nOtsu (filtre fond) + Macenko" as PATCH

rectangle "<b>ResNet50 (pré-entraîné ImageNet)</b>\nlayer4 → vecteur 2048-d\npar patch" as RESNET #D6EAF8

rectangle "<b>Features par patch</b>\nN × 2048-d" as FEAT #FDEBD0

rectangle "<b>Attention MLP (gated ABMIL)</b>\nh → tanh → softmax\n→ poids αᵢ par patch" as ATT #FEF5E7

rectangle "<b>Pooling pondéré</b>\nz = Σ αᵢ · hᵢ → embedding lame" as POOL #D6EAF8

rectangle "<b>Têtes de classification (sigmoid)</b>\nTête TP53      ·      Tête IDH1      ·      Tête KRAS" as HEADS #D5F5E3

rectangle "<b>Grad-CAM</b>\nHooks sur layer4 → carte de chaleur\nsur le patch de plus forte attention" as GC #FADBD8

WSI -down-> PATCH
PATCH -down-> RESNET
RESNET -down-> FEAT
FEAT -down-> ATT
ATT -down-> POOL
POOL -down-> HEADS
RESNET .right.> GC : hooks gradients

@enduml
